<p>
  Narrative Science was a pioneering AI company that transformed complex data
  into clear, human-readable narratives — stories. Its core technology, natural
  language generation, powered products that helped non-analysts understand
  business insights instantly, without dashboards or manual analysis. The company
  was acquired by Salesforce in 2021.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Lexio</strong> was the flagship product — the company's big bet to
  replace complicated dashboards of data. It was designed to empower anyone to
  understand the key insights within complicated data sets by simply reading
  stories written using artificial intelligence.
</p>

<p>
  Unlike Narrative Science's other products, which sat on top of BI tools, Lexio
  was a SaaS offering people could access from any computer, tablet or mobile
  device. It turned data into interactive stories, written in plain English,
  making analytics easy and accessible for anyone — a revolutionary new way of
  using data that shook up the traditional analytics industry.
</p>
